sequenceDiagram
    accTitle: Sign-in with a passkey
    accDescr: The app asks the server for a challenge, the device signs it, and the server issues a session.
    autonumber
    actor P as Person
    participant App as Koru app
    participant Server
    participant DB as Session store

    P->>+App: Sign in
    App->>+Server: Request challenge
    Server-->>-App: Challenge
    Note over App,Server: The challenge expires after 60 s
    loop Until the person confirms or cancels
        App->>P: Ask for passkey
        P-->>App: Touch sensor
    end
    alt Signature valid
        App->>+Server: Signed challenge
        Server->>DB: Create session
        DB-->>Server: Session id
        Server-->>-App: Session token
    else Signature rejected
        Server--xApp: Rejected
        Note right of App: Shows "Try again"
    end
    opt Remember this device
        App-)Server: Register device
    end
    App-->>-P: Signed in
